---
/** 2024 general election figures for Oforikrom. Update after each election. */
---

<section class="wrap py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="display-lg">Our starting line for 2028.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[44ch] text-lg text-ink-2">
        These are the 2024 results we build on. Every new member, branch executive and polling agent moves these numbers.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-muted">
        Source: December 2024 results as published by{' '}
        <a class="link font-medium" href="https://www.graphic.com.gh/ghana-elections/ashanti/oforikrom-constituency-presidential-and-parliamentary-results-election-2024.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Graphic Online</a>{' '}
        and{' '}
        <a class="link font-medium" href="https://www.ghanaweb.com/elections/2024/constituency-results/Oforikrom-319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GhanaWeb</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-x-10 gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-7">
      <div class="sm:col-span-2" data-reveal style="--d:1">
        <p class="font-display text-[clamp(4rem,11vw,8.5rem)] font-extrabold leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.04em] text-accent-text [font-stretch:80%]">
          24,970
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-[42ch] text-lg text-ink-2">
          Oforikrom votes for President John Dramani Mahama in 2024, a <strong class="text-ink">35.2%</strong> share.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t-2 border-ink pt-5" data-reveal style="--d:2">
        <p class="font-display text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em] [font-stretch:82%]">33.7%</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-2">NDC share of the parliamentary vote, 24,483 votes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t-2 border-ink pt-5" data-reveal style="--d:3">
        <p class="font-display text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em] [font-stretch:82%]">15</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-2">Electoral areas across four zonal councils, each with its own branches.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
